dsh-kimino-theme README · Wallpaper and logos：- **Two wallpaper variants**: the skin form ships `kimino` (static cinematic still) and `kimino-live` (1080p silent seamless-loop video, 0.6s crossfaded head/tail, only 0.78MB) — clean stillness or drifting light behind the glass, your pick (see the Skin-center route); the plugin form **defaults to the live wallpaper** (served at `/kimino-bg/live.mp4`, `assets/live.mp4` inside the package) and switches back to the static image (`/kimino-bg/current.jpg`) from the control center. All variants stack a subtle dark gradient for text legibility;
- The expanded sidebar shows the horizontal movie logo; the collapsed rail shows a letter mark (two SVGs, also plugin-served);
- The hero headline is replaced with a large centered logo.
